## Development

This project uses [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) for dependency management
and [just](https://github.com/casey/just) as a task runner.

```sh
just sync           # install dependencies
just fmt            # format code
just lint           # lint with ruff{% if with_web_frontend %} and deno{% endif %}
just typecheck      # type-check with ty{% if with_web_frontend %} and deno{% endif %}
just check          # lint + typecheck + format-check (no modifications)
just test           # run tests
{%- if with_web_frontend %}
just frontend-build # bundle the frontend into src/{{ package_name }}/static
{%- endif %}
{%- if is_app %}
just run [args]     # run the app{% if with_web_frontend %} (builds the frontend first){% endif %}
{%- endif %}
just build          # build sdist and wheel{% if with_web_frontend %} (includes the bundled frontend){% endif %}
just docs           # serve docs locally
just hooks-install  # run checks automatically on commit
just bump [level]   # tag the next version (patch/minor/major), default patch
```

## CI

GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`) runs `just ci` on every push and
pull request: `check` (lint, type-check, format-check), tests, a docs
build, and a package build.

